        <mxCell id="scope" value="Scope and evolution from DA1&#10;&#10;Preserved: operator UI, Gateway, AI ingestion, relational persistence and the AWS EC2 / Docker boundary.&#10;Updated: PostgreSQL -&gt; MySQL 8.4; Nginx routing and the supporting Spring Boot backend are explicit.&#10;Deferred: reporting worker, S3, YOLO/PyTorch, Jenkins, GitHub Actions and Prometheus/Grafana integrations.&#10;AI is shown as the demo service evidenced by the supplied code; live camera inference is a future extension." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#24364B;fillColor=#FAFBFC;strokeColor=#BDC8D2;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
